solution.p:
The coordinates of the points are {\left(-1,-2\right)} and {\left(4,2\right)}\text{.} We apply the rate of change formula:
\begin{aligned}
\amp\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\
\amp= \frac{{2-\left(-2\right)}}{{4-\left(-1\right)}}\\
\amp= \frac{{4}}{{5}}
\end{aligned}
So the rate of change is {{\frac{4}{5}}}\text{.}

